WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.165
Hello I'm a citizen.

00:00:01.165 --> 00:00:05.580
And I'm the government, and we are building a brand new sports ball stadium.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.920
I love sports ball.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:10.720
Great because we are building it right where your house used to be.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:11.960
What?

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.560
What?

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.600
I don't want to sell my house.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:19.120
Oh oh I'm not asking.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:22.540
Wait did—did you use the past tense?

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:23.540
Hello I'm a citizen.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.600
And I'm the government.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.020
My friends and I have been concerned about you using excessive force.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:41.920
Ahhh!

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.040
Hello I'm a citizen.

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:43.920
And I'm the government.

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:49.200
We've decided to push our transportation infrastructure by building a brand new streetcar.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.020
Okay that could help me get from home to work.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.480
Oh great you live between third and fifth street?

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:58.080
No I live on 24th street.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:04.620
Oh.

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.060
Is it going to go to 24th street?

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:07.800
Nope.

